text", "text": ".71", "bbox": {"x": 177.7, "y": 1092.1, "width": 32.30000000000001, "height": 19.40000000000009}}, {"kind": "text", "text": "1.04", "bbox": {"x": 171.2, "y": 1056.6, "width": 45.19999999999999, "height": 19.40000000000009}}, {"kind": "text", "text": ".23", "bbox": {"x": 174.5, "y": 1017.8, "width": 35.5, "height": 22.59999999999991}}, {"kind": "text", "text": "n.s", "bbox": {"x": 174.5, "y": 979.0, "width": 35.5, "height": 19.399999999999977}}, {"kind": "text", "text": "Statistical significance was considered at p < .05; VO2 max = maximum rate of oxygen (O2) consumption; Lat = Lat machine test value; chest = chest press", "bbox": {"x": 138.9, "y": 935.2, "width": 1389.3, "height": 33.5}}, {"kind": "text", "text": "test value; press = leg press test value; Lext = leg extension test value; VB = vertical bending value at sit and reach test, HB = horizontal bending values at sit", "bbox": {"x": 138.9, "y": 911.2, "width": 1389.2, "height": 25.799999999999955}}, {"kind": "text", "text": "and reach test.", "bbox": {"x": 1395.6, "y": 891.8, "width": 135.70000000000005, "height": 19.399999999999977}}, {"kind": "text", "text": "The model consists in a multidisciplinary approach", "bbox": {"x": 852.9, "y": 762.5, "width": 639.6999999999999, "height": 32.299999999999955}}, {"kind": "text", "text": "focused on family's involvement and based on the best", "bbox": {"x": 852.9, "y": 733.5, "width": 675.1999999999999, "height": 32.299999999999955}}, {"kind": "text", "text": "practices of childhood obesity treatment [18, 23, 24, 37, 39].", "bbox": {"x": 869.0, "y": 697.9, "width": 659.0, "height": 35.5}}, {"kind": "text", "text": "Evidence suggests that a multidisciplinary approach is", "bbox": {"x": 856.1, "y": 665.6, "width": 636.4, "height": 32.299999999999955}}, {"kind": "text", "text": "the most effective strategy to promote lifestyle changes and", "bbox": {"x": 856.0, "y": 630.8, "width": 672.3, "height": 38.799999999999955}}, {"kind": "text", "text": "confirms that family involvement and peer support with", "bbox": {"x": 856.1, "y": 601.0, "width": 671.9999999999999, "height": 32.299999999999955}}, {"kind": "text", "text": "group meetings are the key to ensure adherence to the healthy", "bbox": {"x": 852.9, "y": 571.9, "width": 675.1999999999999, "height": 32.299999999999955}}, {"kind": "text", "text": "path [35, 36, 38]. In line with previous evidence, the results of", "bbox": {"x": 852.9, "y": 539.6, "width": 675.1999999999999, "height": 32.299999999999955}}, {"kind": "text", "text": "this study seem to be able to show how a multidisciplinary", "bbox": {"x": 856.1, "y": 507.3, "width": 671.9999999999999, "height": 32.30000000000001}}, {"kind": "text", "text": "approach based on the family is effective not only in children", "bbox": {"x": 856.1, "y": 475.0, "width": 671.9999999999999, "height": 35.5}}, {"kind": "text", "text": "but also in the adolescent group, where a significant decrease", "bbox": {"x": 852.9, "y": 442.7, "width": 675.1999999999999, "height": 32.30000000000001}}, {"kind": "text", "text": "in waist circumference (p < .001), a significant reduction of", "bbox": {"x": 849.7, "y": 410.4, "width": 678.3999999999999, "height": 35.5}}, {"kind": "text", "text": "fat body mass percentage (p < .001), and a significant", "bbox": {"x": 852.9, "y": 381.3, "width": 675.1999999999999, "height": 32.30000000000001}}, {"kind": "text", "text": "decrease in waist circumference (p < .001) and in fat", "bbox": {"x": 852.7, "y": 346.9, "width": 675.5, "height": 37.80000000000001}}, {"kind": "text", "text": "body mass percentage (p < 001) were observed as well as", "bbox": {"x": 852.9, "y": 316.6, "width": 675.1999999999999, "height": 32.30000000000001}}, {"kind": "text", "text": "improvement of the nutritional habits (p < .001) and", "bbox": {"x": 856.1, "y": 284.3, "width": 671.9999999999999, "height": 35.5}}, {"kind": "text", "text": "strength parameters (Table 4).", "bbox": {"x": 1188.9, "y": 255.3, "width": 339.20000000000005, "height": 32.30000000000001}}, {"kind": "text", "text": "In particular it is suggested that adolescent family in-", "bbox": {"x": 856.1, "y": 219.7, "width": 636.4, "height": 32.30000000000001}}, {"kind": "text", "text": "volvement and peer support with group meetings are the key", "bbox": {"x": 852.9, "y": 187.4, "width": 675.1999999999999, "height": 32.29999999999998}}, {"kind": "text", "text": "to ensure adherence to the path and promote the lifestyle", "bbox": {"x": 856.1, "y": 155.1, "width": 671.9999999999999, "height": 35.5}}, {"kind": "text", "text": "change: during the physiological intervention three meetings", "bbox": {"x": 135.7, "y": 762.5, "width": 675.2, "height": 32.299999999999955}}, {"kind": "text", "text": "for teenagers (peer) focused on the impact of overweight/", "bbox": {"x": 138.9, "y": 733.5, "width": 675.2, "height": 32.299999999999955}}, {"kind": "text", "text": "obesity, self-esteem, and body image were expected to share", "bbox": {"x": 138.9, "y": 701.1, "width": 672.0, "height": 32.299999999999955}}, {"kind": "text", "text": "among peers (supported by a psychologist) the main risk", "bbox": {"x": 135.7, "y": 668.8, "width": 675.2, "height": 32.299999999999955}}, {"kind": "text", "text": "factors associated with obesity developmental age [18, 39-41].", "bbox": {"x": 138.9, "y": 639.8, "width": 672.0, "height": 29.100000000000023}}, {"kind": "text", "text": "Further studies should better investigate the contribution of", "bbox": {"x": 135.7, "y": 607.4, "width": 675.2, "height": 32.299999999999955}}, {"kind": "text", "text": "such kind of support in the different age-group populations.", "bbox": {"x": 148.6, "y": 575.1, "width": 662.3, "height": 32.299999999999955}}, {"kind": "text", "text": "Furthermore evidence shows that adherence to physical", "bbox": {"x": 142.0, "y": 542.3, "width": 636.7, "height": 30.0}}, {"kind": "text", "text": "activity is poor when only children and adolescent are", "bbox": {"x": 135.5, "y": 505.9, "width": 675.6, "height": 39.799999999999955}}, {"kind": "text", "text": "involved without their families or friends [28, 29, 66] and that", "bbox": {"x": 135.7, "y": 481.4, "width": 675.2, "height": 29.100000000000023}}, {"kind": "text", "text": "restricting diet causes damaging effects on health and it is not", "bbox": {"x": 135.7, "y": 445.9, "width": 675.2, "height": 32.30000000000001}}, {"kind": "text", "text": "effective in the long term [18, 67].", "bbox": {"x": 436.1, "y": 413.6, "width": 374.80000000000007, "height": 32.30000000000001}}, {"kind": "text", "text": "Multicomponent approach structured in an intervention", "bbox": {"x": 142.0, "y": 379.6, "width": 636.6, "height": 31.600000000000023}}, {"kind": "text", "text": "model including simultaneously nutritional aspects, physical", "bbox": {"x": 138.9, "y": 345.7, "width": 672.0, "height": 32.30000000000001}}, {"kind": "text", "text": "activity, sedentary time reduction, and behavioral changes", "bbox": {"x": 142.1, "y": 316.6, "width": 668.7, "height": 25.80000000000001}}, {"kind": "text", "text": "can deliver better outcomes than isolated interventions [18,", "bbox": {"x": 138.9, "y": 287.6, "width": 672.0, "height": 32.30000000000001}}, {"kind": "text", "text": "39]. The inclusion of the family in children's treatment", "bbox": {"x": 135.7, "y": 252.0, "width": 675.2, "height": 32.30000000000001}}, {"kind": "text", "text": "programs helps children and parents to overcome barriers of", "bbox": {"x": 135.7, "y": 222.9, "width": 675.2, "height": 32.29999999999998}}, {"kind": "text", "text": "lifestyle and behavioral changes [29] treatment is optimized", "bbox": {"x": 138.9, "y": 190.6, "width": 672.0, "height": 29.099999999999994}}, {"kind": "text", "text": "if family members are specifically targeted in treatment.", "bbox": {"x": 190.6, "y": 158.3, "width": 623.5, "height": 32.30000000000001}}], "ms": 258.85}